# Git branching

Do not implement features or fixes directly on `main`.

- Create a dedicated branch for each feature, fix, or topic (e.g. `feat/...`, `fix/...`, `chore/...`)
- Keep `main` as the integration branch for reviewed, complete work
- Name branches after the change intent, in English and kebab-case

```text
# ❌ BAD
git checkout main
# ... edit files and commit on main ...

# ✅ GOOD
git checkout -b feat/add-cursor-rules
# ... edit, commit, push ...
```
